# KiCad pins (docs/runbooks/toolbox.md, "KiCad"). Read by scripts/pc/install-kicad.sh.
# Plain KEY=value lines only: no expansion, no commands.

# KiCad's official stable PPA for 10.0 (https://www.kicad.org/download/linux-distros/), noble build.
KICAD_PPA_URL=https://ppa.launchpadcontent.net/kicad/kicad-10.0-releases/ubuntu
# "Launchpad PPA for KiCad", created 2020-07-07, no expiry. The fingerprint Launchpad shows on
# https://launchpad.net/~kicad/+archive/ubuntu/kicad-10.0-releases, checked 2026-11-17 against the
# key fetched from keyserver.ubuntu.com (kicad-ppa.asc beside this file).
KICAD_PPA_KEY_FPR=FDA854F61C4D0D9572BB95E5245D5502FAD7A805
# Binary packages kicad, kicad-symbols and kicad-footprints 10.0.8 (Launchpad lists their source
# packages, kicad and kicad-library-*, uploaded 2026-10-29 and 2026-10-30), so at least 7 days old on 2026-11-17. The PPA keeps only its latest
# upload: moving on is a change of this line and a rerun.
KICAD_VERSION=10.0.8~ubuntu24.04.1
